WEBVTT

00:02:58.250 --> 00:03:00.268
You've seen it a thousand times.

00:03:00.292 --> 00:03:02.559
Make no mistake,

00:03:02.583 --> 00:03:06.101
this is a remarkable tradition
in our country.

00:03:06.125 --> 00:03:07.476
Because at that moment,

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:10.393
that candidate still has at her command

00:03:10.417 --> 00:03:14.893
a nationwide army of campaign activists,

00:03:14.917 --> 00:03:16.976
of die-hard partisans,

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:19.309
tens of thousands of people.

00:03:19.333 --> 00:03:21.518
They could just as easily take up arms,

00:03:21.542 --> 00:03:22.809
take to the streets,

00:03:22.833 --> 00:03:24.601
they could do whatever they want to.

00:03:24.625 --> 00:03:28.601
But that concession speech
instantly demobilizes all of them.

00:03:28.625 --> 00:03:30.976
It says, "Hey, guys, stand down.